#: src/doc.cls.php:69
msgid "This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily."
msgstr "Wannan shafin yana amfani da fasahar ajiye bayanai na wucin gadi (caching) domin samar da saurin amsawa da ingantacciyar ƙwarewar mai amfani. Ajiye bayanai na wucin gadi na iya adana kwafin kowane shafin yanar gizo da ke nunawa a wannan shafin. Duk fayilolin ajiya na ɗan lokaci ne, kuma wani ɓangare na uku baya samun damar shiga su, sai dai idan ya zama dole don samun goyon bayan fasaha daga mai kawo sabis din. Fayilolin ajiyar suna karewa a cikin wani lokaci da mai gudanar da shafin ya tsara, amma mai gudanar da shafin zai iya goge su kafin lokacin karewarsu idan ya zama dole. Muna iya amfani da sabis na QUIC.cloud don sarrafawa da adana bayanan ku na ɗan lokaci."

