msgstr "Kayayyaki"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:890
msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "Fitowar da saituna"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:893
msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Sake wa ga tsoffin saituna"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:894
msgid "This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?"
msgstr "Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari na wannan plugin zuwa asalinsa. A ci gaba?"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:901
msgid "Diagnostics for support"
msgstr "Binciken kuskure don tallafi"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:910
msgid "Import a settings file"
msgstr "Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:914
msgid "Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site."
msgstr "Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunshe da kalmomin sirri, alamomi (tokens) ko maɓallan API — za buƙaci ka sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1013
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "An adana saitunan."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1060
msgid "Every setting on this plugin is back to its default."
msgstr "Kowane saiti a kan wannan plugin ya dawo zuwa tsohuwar sigarsa ta asali."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1103
msgid "Done."
msgstr "An gama."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1107
msgid "That action is not available."
msgstr "Ba a samun damar yin Wannan aiki."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1174
msgid "That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin."
msgstr "Ba a iya karanta fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saiti da aka fitar daga wani kari na Zinn®."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1182
msgid "That file is too large to be a settings export."
msgstr "Wancan fayil din yayi girma da yawa don ya zama fitar da saituna."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1195
msgid "That file is not a Zinn® settings export."
msgstr "Wancan fayil ba shi da fitarwa ta saitunan Zinn®."

#. translators: %s: the plugin slug the file was exported from.
#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1203
#, php-format
msgid "That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand."
msgstr "An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani plugin daban (%s), don haka shigo da shi anan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin bai fahimta ba."

#. translators: %d: how many settings were imported.
#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-admin-ui.php:1233
#, php-format
msgid "%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again."
msgid_plural "%d settings imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again."
msgstr[0] "An shigo da saitin %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, saboda haka a sake shigar da su."
msgstr[1] "An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a taba sanya kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka a sake shigar da su."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:58
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Haɗe"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:60
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Ana haɗawa…"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:62
msgid "Connected, but something needs attention"
msgstr "An haɗa, amma wani abu na bukatar kulawa"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:64
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Ba a haɗa shi ba"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:66
msgid "Running on your own account"
msgstr "Ana gudu a kan asusunka naka"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:68
msgid "We could not check this"
msgstr "Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:93
msgid "This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look."
msgstr "Wannan plugin ɗin bai faɗi dalili ba. A tura rahoton bincike sai mu duba."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:161
msgid "Connection status"
msgstr "Matsayin haɗi"

#. translators: %s: a human-readable interval such as "5 minutes".
#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "Last checked %s ago."
msgstr "An bincika karshe tun %s."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-connection.php:251
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:199
msgid "Send this to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Aika da wannan zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:201
msgid "This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it."
msgstr "Wannan shi neini abin da za a aika — babu wani abu kuma, kuma babu abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrin ku, alamomin shiga da maɓallan API ba su ciki."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:204
msgid "The diagnostics report that will be sent"
msgstr "Rahoton binciken da za a aika"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:207
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Kwafi zuwa allo"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:214
msgid "Send this report to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Aika wannan rahoto zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:216
msgid "We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself."
msgstr "Mun buɗe tikitin goyon baya don ku kuma mun ba da amsa ta imel. Idan kun fi son kada ku aika da shi, kwafi shi a sama kuma ku liƙa shi a cikin tikiti da kanku."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:228
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "An kwafi"

#. translators: %s: the transport error reported by WordPress.
#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong."
msgstr "Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya ɓace game da saitunanka."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:288
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email."
msgstr "An tura. Taimakon Zinn® yana da rahotonku kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel."

#. translators: %s: the support reference for the report just sent.
#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:291
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email."
msgstr "Tallafin Zinn® yana da rahotonku — lamba ta tunani %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:300
msgid "You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive."
msgstr "Kun aika rahotanni da yawa cikin ɗan kankanin lokaci. Jira na 'yan mintuna sannan ka sake gwadawa — waɗanda suka gabata sun isa."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:307
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket."
msgstr "Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — wannan matsalar ce ta ɓangarenmu, ba ta taku ba. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ku kwafi rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin tikiti."

#. translators: %d: the HTTP status code the server returned.
#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-diagnostics.php:315
#, php-format
msgid "The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number."
msgstr "An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lambar."

