#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-promo.php:374
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Zinn® hosting don WordPress"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-promo.php:375
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-promo.php:381
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Kasuwancin Zinn®"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-promo.php:382
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Sayi da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yankunan yanar gizo, da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da ajiyar kuɗi lafiya har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-promo.php:429
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — ka ɗauki ma'aikatan da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana'a"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-promo.php:430
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko kuma sanya aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-style-presets.php:109
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "Tsarin salo"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-style-presets.php:110
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "Wani wurin farawa. Duk wani abu da ke ƙasa yana shige masa gaba."

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-style-presets.php:117
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "Yi amfani da launi na da girman da na ke so"

#: zinn/class-zinn-cache-pro-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da saitaccen tsari yadda yake ainihi."
